  "details": "Version: 2019.3.2p2\n\nDescription of the bug:\nWhen dropping a portal, a rare bug may happen when any invite+/invite/friends/friends+ portals change to public instead. Not sure what the cause is, but it's happened a number of times in the past few days specifically.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nDropped a portal that was friends+ or higher, portal drops a public instead. Rare.",
